        <body>&lt;p&gt;The Zoned Location changes have been completed.  Please review your zoned locations for accuracy.  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Refer to this training deck for a summary of all the changes. &lt;a href=&quot;https://orhs.sharepoint.com/:p:/s/PRMSalesforceLightningMigration/EX_cDRspx_FPmXxlDtejdrUBbSwXvoIBnHfsfFnSFaVm1A?e=FV82Kg&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Zoned Location Enhancements&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;For any questions or to report any issues, please post in the PRM Team chatter group and use the topic &lt;strong&gt;#Zoned Location Enhancements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</body>
